QuestGuidance.Register("en",330,{
[10529]="70041AF1\n1\tDefeat Scythe-jaw\tScythe-jaw can be found somewhere in Ringló Vale. You should defeat Scythe-jaw.\n2\tSpeak with Candúr\tCandúr can be found in the village of Ethring. You should speak with Candúr.\n",
[10530]="70042888\n1\tDefeat Shakatrog\tShakatrog can be found somewhere in Angmar. You should defeat Shakatrog.\n2\tSpeak with Cánnakh\tCánnakh can be found in Aughaire. You should speak with Cánnakh.\n",
[10531]="70042F73\n1\tDefeat Shardrágh\tShardrágh can be found somewhere in South Ithilien or Osgiliath. You should defeat Shardrágh.\n2\tSpeak with Nanoth\tNanoth can be found in Bâr Húrin. You should speak with Nanoth.\n",
[10532]="70042883\n1\tDefeat Skorkaz\tSkorkaz can be found somewhere in Western Gondor. You should defeat Skorkaz.\n2\tSpeak with Aelnir\tAelnir can be found in the city of Dol Amroth. You should speak with Aelnir.\n",
[10533]="70043C22\n1\tDefeat Súnath\tSúnath can be found somewhere in Evendim. You should defeat Súnath.\n2\tSpeak with Brangil\tBrangil can be found in Tinnudir. You should speak with Brangil.\n",
[10534]="70042887\n1\tDefeat Sútmoth\tSútmoth can be found somewhere in The Misty Mountains. You should defeat Sútmoth.\n2\tSpeak with Authi\tAuthi can be found in Glóin's Camp in the Misty Mountains. You should speak with Authi.\n",
[10535]="70043C29\n1\tDefeat Thorang\tThorang can be found somewhere in Southern Mirkwood. You should defeat Thorang.\n2\tSpeak with Gellamiel\tGellamiel can be found in Ost Galadh. You should speak with Gellamiel.\n",
[10536]="700473A9\n1\tDefeat Tumoz the Fume\tTumoz the Fume can be found patrolling The Wastes. You have encountered Tumoz the Fume and should defeat the beast for those who brave these harsh lands.\n2\tDefeat Tumoz the Fume\tTumoz the Fume can be found patrolling The Wastes. You have encountered Tumoz the Fume and should defeat the beast for those who brave these harsh lands.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have defeated Tumoz the Fume.\n",
[10537]="70043C28\n1\tDefeat Tárlug\tTárlug can be found somewhere in Evendim. You should defeat Tárlug.\n2\tSpeak with Brangil\tBrangil can be found in Tinnudir. You should speak with Brangil.\n",
[10538]="70042896\n1\tDefeat Ukko Surma\tUkko Surma can be found somewhere in Forochel. You should defeat Ukko Surma.\n2\tSpeak with Ostasänt\tOstasänt can be found in Sûri-kylä. You should speak with Ostasänt.\n",
[10539]="7004289A\n1\tDefeat Ulkharn\tUlkharn can be found somewhere in Angmar. You should defeat Ulkharn.\n2\tSpeak with Cánnakh\tCánnakh can be found in Aughaire. You should speak with Cánnakh.\n",
[10540]="70043C23\n1\tDefeat Valikas\tValikas can be found somewhere in The North Downs. You should defeat Valikas.\n2\tSpeak with Othwen\tOthwen can be found in Esteldín. You should speak with Othwen.\n",
[10541]="70042886\n1\tDefeat Vélnas\tVélnas can be found somewhere in Angmar. You should defeat Vélnas.\n2\tSpeak with Cánnakh\tCánnakh can be found in Aughaire. You should speak with Cánnakh.\n",
[10542]="70043C27\n1\tDefeat Woe-weaver\tWoe-weaver can be found somewhere in Southern Mirkwood. You should defeat Woe-weaver.\n2\tSpeak with Gellamiel\tGellamiel can be found in Ost Galadh. You should speak with Gellamiel.\n",
[10543]="7004288A\n1\tSpeak with Authi\tAuthi can be found in Glóin's Camp. You should speak with Authi.\n2\tSpeak with Authi\tAuthi can be found in Glóin's Camp. You should speak with Authi.\n",
[10544]="700304AC\n1\tDefeat Easterling guards at Súth-torr (total: 6)\tThe fallen Rohirrim watch-tower is in the north-east corner of their large encampment of Jóshkhin Orda to the north of North-torr. You should defeat the guards of Súth-torr.\n2\tReturn to Guthferth, Sergeant of North-torr\tSergeant Guthferth is at North-torr just north of Floodwend. You should speak with Sergeant Guthferth.\n",
[10545]="7005784C\n1\tCatch ruby fireflies (total: 12)\tYou can find ruby fireflies in Rushock Bog from gloaming till dawn. You should collect fireflies for the wedding planner in Minas Tirith.\n2\tTalk to Merilien\tThe wedding planner Merilien is located on the Seventh Circle of Minas Tirith. Return to Minas Tirith with the firefly-filled lanterns.\n3\tPlace ruby firefly lanterns ([see journal]/4)\tThe Hall of Air is on the northern end of the Fifth Circle of Minas Tirith. You should place the ruby firefly lanterns at the event location.\n",
[10546]="70062DDB\n1\tDefeat ruffians in Ruddymore (total: 8)\tRuffians can be found throughout Ruddymore, and are a danger to the people of the area.\n2\tTalk to Alwena outside the Hall of Crafts in Herne\tAlwena is outside the Hall of Crafts in Herne.\n3\tTalk to the guard of recent employ in the Hall of Crafts\tThe new guard hired by Alwena can be found inside the Hall of Crafts.\n4\tTalk to Alwena outside the Hall of Crafts in Herne\tAlwena is outside the Hall of Crafts in Herne.\n",
[10547]="7002BF8B\n1\tDefeat treasure-seekers (total: 10)\tTreasure-seekers may be found at Atburg, south-east of Aculf's camp in the Rushgore. Aculf wants you to defeat a number of the brigand treasure-seekers in hopes of driving them from the Rushgore.\n2\tTalk to Eowils outside Atburg in the Rushgore\tEowils is outside Atburg in the Rushgore, south-east of Aculf's camp. Aculf instructed you to report your successes to the scout Eowils.\n",
[10548]="7001E98A\n1\tDestroy blighted wood pile (total: 5)\tBlighted wood stockpiles may be found at Ânghum-maudhûl, south-east of Mithechad along the central road. Harchador has asked you to find and destroy the Orcs' blighted wood stockpiles.\n2\tTalk to Harchador at Mithechad\tHarchador is at Mithechad, north-west of Ânghum-maudhûl. You should speak with Harchador and let him know that the Orcs' blighted wood stockpiles have been destroyed.\n",
[10549]="7004146A\n1\tDefeat Corsair vandals near Roamingstar's glade (total: 8)\030Recover tribute baskets stolen from the Gilrain (total: 4)\tCorsair vandals and stolen tribute baskets can be found on the outskirts of Roamingstar's glade. Roamingstar has asked you to punish the Men encroaching on her glade and dishonouring her people.\n2\tTalk to Roamingstar\tRoamingstar can be found in her glade in north-eastern Dor-en-Ernil. You have defeated many of the Corsairs threatening Roamingstar's glade and retrieved the baskets woven for her by the people of Gondor. You should now return to Roamingstar.\n",
[10550]="70000106\n1\tTalk to Istuienn\tAsk Istuienn about the Book of the Five Towns.\n2\tFind the Founding Stone of Dolindîr, now called Esteldín\tFind the Founding Stone of Dolindîr, now called Esteldín.\n3\tTalk to Istuienn\tSpeak further with Istuienn about the Book of the Five Towns.\n4\tFind the Stone of Henneth Rhún\030Find the Stone of Duintham\030Find the Stone of Carnoglin\030Find the Stone of Ost Ardúlin\tFind the remaining Founding Stones.\n5\tTalk to Istuienn\tReturn to Istuienn to tell the tale of your exploration.\n",
[10551]="70009E7D\n1\tTalk to Lieutenant Ingi\tLieutenant Ingi is at Ost Ringdyr, north and east of Glân Vraig. Sergeant-at-Arms Ascwyn directed you to report to Ost Ringdyr to learn about the allies of Angmar's Army from Lieutenant Ingi.\n",
[10552]="7005A807\n1\tTalk to Gori to travel to the ruins\tGori Stonesetter can be found in Amdân. Gori has asked you to accompany him to the bridge that crosses the Kibil-nâla.\n2\tTalk to Gori\tGori Stonesetter can be found in Amdân. Gori has asked you to talk with him in Amdân.\n",
[10553]="7006000C\n1\tTravel to Leitstáth\tLeitstáth can be found in south east Câr Bronach. You should travel to Leitstáth.\n2\tTalk to Kúzun at Leitstáth\tKúzun can be found at Leitstáth. You should talk to Kúzun.\n3\tTalk to Órug at Leitstáth\tÓrug can be found at Leitstáth. You should talk to Órug.\n",
[10554]="70051395\n1\tInvestigate the north-west mine entrance\030Investigate the north mine entrance\030Investigate the north-east mine entrance\030Investigate the east mine entrance\030Investigate the south-east mine entrance\tEntrances to the mines can be found in Hammerstead. You should investigate the mine entrances in Hammerstead.\n2\tTalk to Aflur Smokebeard\tAflur Smokebeard can be found at Hammerstead. You should talk to Aflur Smokebeard.\n",
[10555]="7006BF78\n1\tGo to Nâmbadir, the Span of Princes and search for signs of Orcs\tGo to Nâmbadir, the Span of Princes to the east of Kûr Anzar and search for signs of Orcs.\n2\tGo a third of the way onto Nâmbadir and scout south\tGo a third of the way onto the span of Nâmbadir and scout south.\n3\tGo half of the way onto Nâmbadir and scout north\tGo half of the way onto the span of Nâmbadir and scout north.\n4\tGo two-thirds of the way onto Nâmbadir and scout east, towards Urash Dâr\tGo two-thirds of the way onto the span of Nâmbadir and scout east, towards Urash Dâr.\n5\tReturn to Numûru in Urmâkh with your report\tReturn to Numûru in Urmâkh with your report.\n",
[10556]="700097A5\n1\tUse Chest of the Worm\030Collect Delicate Key\tThere are chests hidden all around Tyl Ruinen, and one of them contains the solution to Rumming's riddle. The riddle goes: Lesser get of Ancalagon's spawn Taloned claws and fang-gaped yawn. Scatha's tears would surely flow Saw he his children laid so low. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n2\tTalk to Humfrey Rumming\030Collect Token of the Worm\tHumfrey Rumming is by the ruins of Tollobel on Tyl Ruinen. You have obtained the token of the worm from a chest on Tyl Ruinen. Bring it back to Humfrey Rumming, if you believe it is the solution to his riddle.\n",
[10557]="700097A7\n1\tUse Chest of the Warg\030Collect Delicate Key\tThere are chests hidden all around Tyl Ruinen, and one of them contains the solution to Rumming's riddle. The riddle goes: Foul great beasts with sharpened claws; Black-furred pelts and fanged maws; Coursing the woods, they take their prey; Torment their victim, at last to slay. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n2\tTalk to Humfrey Rumming\030Collect Token of the Warg\tHumfrey Rumming is by the ruins of Tollobel on Tyl Ruinen. You have obtained the token of the Warg from a chest on Tyl Ruinen. Bring it back to Humfrey Rumming if you believe it is the solution to his riddle.\n",
[10558]="70009794\n1\tUse Chest of the Bat\030Collect Delicate Key\tThere are boxes hidden all around Tyl Ruinen, and one of them contains the solution to Rumming's riddle. The riddle goes: Fluttering shreds rent from the fabric of night; Fell shrieking beasts that shun the sun's light; Dwelling in darkness they fly hidden from sight; Clouds obscure the stars when first they take flight. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n2\tTalk to Humfrey Rumming\030Collect Token of the Bat\tHumfrey Rumming is by the ruins of Tollobel on Tyl Ruinen. You have obtained the token of the bat from a chest on Tyl Ruinen. Bring it back to Humfrey Rumming if you believe it is the solution to his riddle.\n",
[10559]="7002D3C2\n1\tDefeat goblin-messengers in Snaga-maudhûl (total: 4)\tGoblin-messengers can be found running along Snaga-maudhûl, the goblin-camp on the west road in the Great Delving. You should defeat the malicious messengers so that they will stop reporting the movements of the dwarves along the roads.\n2\tFind Wegil on the other side of Snaga-maudhûl\tWegil is outside the back gate of Snaga-maudhûl. You should speak with Wegil on your way eastwards through the Great Delving.\n",
[10560]="7000C37F\n1\tCollect the orders\tGoblin-town lies to the north-east of Glóin's camp. Glóin sent you back to Goblin-town to find the orders carried by the Uruks from Angmar to the goblins of Goblin-town. You will need to locate the place within Goblin-town where the Uruks have gathered.\n2\tReturn the orders to Glóin at his camp outside of Goblin-town\030Collect Uruk Orders\tGloín awaits you at his camp just outside of Goblin-town. You should bring the papers you recovered to Glóin so that he may evaluate them.\n",
})
